  "_comment": "How a heard word becomes a thing. 'map' sends a lemma to an object key, which is how abstract words get a symbol a child would draw (love -> heart, night -> moon) and how synonyms share one object that grows every time either is sung. 'objects' gives each key the phrase Tripo is asked for. 'skip' is for words with no honest picture. Anything in none of the three is taken literally: a noun nobody planned for becomes itself. Edit freely, no code changes needed.",

